정부/공공기관 문서를 열람하는 시민\n가정통신문을 확인하는 학부모\n계약서/보고서를 확인하는 직장인\n한컴 오피스가 없는 macOS/Linux 사용자\nHWP 파일을 열기 위해 별도 프로그램을 설치하고 싶지 않은 모든 분\nMIT 라이선스 — 개인/기업 모두 무료.\n\n다운로드 링크 ▽▽▽▽▽▽","author":{"handle":"","name":"인용: (URL 미확인)"},"media":[],"stats":{},"category":""},"replies":[{"tweetId":"2044745586734506478","sourceUrl":"https://x.com/ohmahahm/status/2044745586734506478","capturedAt":"2026-10-07T16:32:49.096219+00:00","createdAt":"Apr 16","fullText":"https://chromewebstore.google.com/detail/pgakpjflombjmehnebnbpnalhegaanag?utm_source=item-share-cb…","author":{"handle":"@ohmahahm","name":"Oh Hahm Ma (@ohmahahm)"},"media":[],"stats":{},"category":"","isThread":true},{"tweetId":"2044748703152652773","sourceUrl":"https://x.com/hys___b/status/2044748703152652773","capturedAt":"2026-10-07T16:32:49.096219+00:00","createdAt":"Apr 16","fullText":"함마님 이런 플러그인도 추천해주십니까😱😱👍👍","author":{"handle":"@hys___b","name":"도비스프리 (@hys___b)"},"media":[],"stats":{},"category":"","isThread":false}]},{"tweetId":"2045275182563049937","sourceUrl":"https://x.com/ErickSky/status/2045275182563049937","capturedAt":"2026-10-07T16:33:27.848218+00:00","createdAt":"7:56 AM · Apr 18, 2026","fullText":"Click to Follow ErickSky","author":{"handle":"@ErickSky","name":"Erick (@ErickSky)"},"media":[],"stats":{},"category":"미수집(빈캡처)","quoted":{"tweetId":"","sourceUrl":"","capturedAt":"2026-10-07T16:33:27.848218+00:00","createdAt":"","fullText":"Goodbye ElevenLabs… your FREE AND LOCAL replacement has arrived\n\n[VoiceBox] \n\nWith just a few seconds of audio you can:\n\n- Clone any voice in seconds\n- 23 languages\n- 5 TTS engines + audio effects\n- DAW-style timeline for podcasts and full conversations\n- 100% on your machine (nothing leaves your PC)\n\nCreators, podcasters, YouTubers, and AI devs are going to adopt it en masse.\n\nREPOOO👇","author":{"handle":"","name":"인용: (URL 미확인)"},"media":[],"stats":{},"category":""},"replies":[{"tweetId":"2045275185129931188","sourceUrl":"https://x.com/ErickSky/status/2045275185129931