3:27.848218+00:00","createdAt":"Apr 18","fullText":"Ese es un excelente uso bro! Darle voz a tu agente Hermes para aumentar la productividad","author":{"handle":"@ErickSky","name":"Erick (@ErickSky)"},"media":[],"stats":{},"category":"","isThread":true}]},{"tweetId":"2046031096140468506","sourceUrl":"https://x.com/AI_jacksaku/status/2046031096140468506","capturedAt":"2026-10-07T16:34:09.395218+00:00","createdAt":"10:00 AM · Apr 20, 2026","fullText":"Click to Follow AI_jacksaku","author":{"handle":"@AI_jacksaku","name":"阿川 | AI thinking (@AI_jacksaku)"},"media":[],"stats":{},"category":"미수집(빈캡처)","quoted":{"tweetId":"","sourceUrl":"","capturedAt":"2026-10-07T16:34:09.395218+00:00","createdAt":"","fullText":"单日暴涨1,169 stars！\nGitHub今日黑马：FinceptTerminal\n\n它是什么？\n\n一个开源的金融分析终端，目标是替代昂贵的Bloomberg Terminal。\n\n听起来很野心对吧？\n但你知道这解决了多大的痛点吗？\n\nBloomberg Terminal年费2万美元起，\n个人投资者根本用不起。\n但做量化分析、看实时行情、研究宏观经济，\n又真的需要专业工具。\n\nFinceptTerminal提供：\n全球市场实时数据\n投资研究工具\n宏观经济指标\n\n技术分析图表\n更狠的是，它完全开源，用Python写的，\n你可以自己接数据源、自己加功能。\n\n我翻了下代码结构，\n核心模块很清晰：数据层、分析层、展示层分离，\n扩展性很强。\n\n这就是金融科技的开源革命：\n专业工具不再是大机构的特权。\n你会用开源工具做投资分析吗？👇\n\n🔗","author":{"handle":"","name":"인용: (URL 미확인)"},"media":[],"stats":{},"category":""},"replies":[{"tweetId":"2046248161593741656","sourceUrl":"https://x.com/AI_jacksaku/status/2046248161593741656","capturedAt":"2026-10-07T16:34:09.395218+00:00","createdAt":"Apr 21","fullText":"这是之前整理的「AI全套攻略（持续更新中）」，感兴趣自取～https://pan.quark.cn/s/a07b6473cf32","author":{"handle":"@AI_jacksaku","name":"阿川 | AI thinking (@AI_jacksaku)"},"media":[],"stats":{},"category":"","isThread":true},{"tweetId":"2046057435883045264","sourceUrl":"https://x.com/FFOMU_F/status/2046057435883045264","capturedAt":"2026-10-07T16:34:09.395218+00:00","createdAt":"Apr 20","fullText":"The real question is data freshness. Bloomberg's moat isn't the terminal UI — it's the proprietary, real-time data feeds that most open-source alternatives can't replicate. FinceptTerminal looks impressive architecturally, but it'll live or die based on which free/freemium data","author":{"handle":"@FFOMU_F","name":"Freddy.Fy (@FFOMU_F)"},"media":[],"stats":{},"category":"","isThread":false},{"tweetId":"2046111258915537250","sourceUrl":"https://x.com/alexattinger/status/2046111258915537250","capturedAt":"2026-10-07T16:34:09.395218+00:00","createdAt":"Apr 20","fullText":"#1 repo on RepoRank!","author":{"handle":"@alexattinger","name":"Alex Attinger (@alexattinger)"},"media":[],"stats":{},"category":"","isThread":false},{"tweetId":"2046260059412517244","sourceUrl":"https://x.com/zy_yang2017/status/2046260059412517244","capturedAt":"2026-10-07T16:34:09.395218+00:00","createdAt":"Apr 21","fullText":"牛逼啊","author":{"handle":"@zy_yang2017","name":"yang zy (@zy_yang2017)"},"media":[],"stats":{},"category":"","isThread":false}]},{"tweetId":"2046996779418423431","sourceUrl":"https://x.com/arena/status/2046996779418423431/photo/1","capturedAt":"2026-10-07T16:32:29.966219+00:00","createdAt":"","fullText":"Click to Follow arena","author":{"handle":"@arena","name":"Arena.ai (@arena)"},"media":[{"type":"photo","url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HGhkNy-b0AA0Cz_?format=jpg&name=large"}],"stats":{},"category":"미수집(빈캡처)","quoted":{"tweetId":"2046670703311884548","sourceUrl":"https://x.com/arena/status/2046670703311884548/photo/1","capturedAt":"2026-10-07T16:32:29.966219+00:00","createdAt":"","fullText":"","author":{"handle":"@arena","name":"인용: @arena"},"media":[{"type":"photo","url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HGc7c9zaEAAwbwW?format=jpg&name=large"}],"stats":{},"category":""},"replies":[{"tweetId":"2046996782354469213","sourceUrl":"https://x.com/arena/status/2046996782354469213","capturedAt":"2026-10-07T16:32:29.966219+00:00","createdAt":"Apr 23","fullText":"Looking at head-to-head battles, GPT-Image-2 won 86% of the time against Nano-Banana-2, its closest competitor. \n\nIt won 92% of the time against its predecessor, GPT-Image-1.5, which was previously OpenAI’s top-performing image model.","author":{"handle":"@arena","name":"Arena.ai (@arena)"},"media":[{"type":"photo","url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HGhkS8AaAAAjLKN?format=jpg&name=large"}],"stats":{},"category":"","isThread":true}]},{"tweetId":"2047222757981860320","sourceUrl":"https://x.com/DeepDive_KR/status/2047222757981860320/photo/1","capturedAt":"2026-10-07T16:33:20.683218+00:00","createdAt":"","fullText":"🤖GPT-image-2 를 Codex Cli 에서 호출하는 방법입니다. 당연히 안될 줄 알았는데 되네요?? 점점 클로드 쓸 이유가 사라지는 중 ㅋㅋㅋㅋㅋ\n\nAPI Key 없이도 image 모델을 호출할 수 있으면 에이전트 기반 자동화 작업이 전부다 GPT 구독 한도 내에서 추가 비용 없이 가능하다는 뜻이니;; SNS 자동화 등을 생각 중이신 분들 입장에서는 어마어마한 비용절감입니다;; \n\n이걸 왜 풀어놨을까요?\n\nOpenAI 공식에서는 유료 모델로 안내하고 있는데,\n Codex 한테 시켜보니 내장 Image-gen 도구가 있어서 이미지 생성이 가능합니다!\n\nCodex 답변으로는 이미지 생성이 되긴 되는데 Gpt-image-2 모델이 맞는지는 확실하지 않다고 해서, 테스트 하나 시켜봤더니 피부 표현 미쳤네요 ㅎㄷㄷ Gpt-image-2 맞는 것 같습니다;;\n(이미지 생성 테스트한 프롬프트: A close-up portrait of an elderly fisherman with deep wrinkles, wearing a yellow raincoat, looking at the camera,\n  dramatic lighting, 8k resolution, photorealistic, shot on 35mm lens, highly detailed.)\n\n막히기 전에 사용해보세요!\n\n특별한 요령은 없고 그냥 Codex한테 \n\nUse the built-in image_gen tool and generate the image 하시고 이미지 생성용 프롬프트 입력하시면 되겠습니다.\n\n랜딩페이지 만드시는 분들이나 등등 생산성 떡상하겠는데요...?","author":{"handle":"@DeepDive_KR","name":"DeepDive (@DeepDive_KR)"},"media":[{"type":"photo","url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HGkweE7bsAAybHE?format=jpg&name=large"}],"stats":{},"category":"AI툴","quoted":{"tweetId":"2046996779418423431","sourceUrl":"https://x.com/arena/status/2046996779418423431/photo/1","capturedAt":"2026-10-07T16:33:20.683218+00:00","createdAt":"","fullText":"","author":{"handle":"@arena","name":"인용: @arena"},"media":[{"type":"photo","url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HGhkNy-b0AA0Cz_?format=jpg&name=large"}],"stats":{},"category":""},"replies":[]},{"tweetId":"2047527388725264526","sourceUrl":"https://x.com/Trader_Jesse_/status/2047527388725264526/photo/1","capturedAt":"2026-10-07T16:33:13.162218+00:00","createdAt":"","fullText":"알멕 같은 케이스도 지지를 기다려보면 선물같은 기회를 줄 수도. 오면 좋고,