gory":"","isThread":true},{"tweetId":"2048351246416048437","sourceUrl":"https://x.com/alterpaper/status/2048351246416048437","capturedAt":"2026-10-07T16:33:56.113218+00:00","createdAt":"Apr 26","fullText":"vram 을 20기가 넘게 먹던데..","author":{"handle":"@alterpaper","name":"Jayden Ryu (@alterpaper)"},"media":[],"stats":{},"category":"","isThread":false},{"tweetId":"2048352090398011522","sourceUrl":"https://x.com/nikke_io/status/2048352090398011522","capturedAt":"2026-10-07T16:33:56.113218+00:00","createdAt":"Apr 26","fullText":"How long does it take to transcribe a one-hour audio file? Nikke did it in 25 seconds.","author":{"handle":"@nikke_io","name":"nikke.io (@nikke_io)"},"media":[],"stats":{},"category":"","isThread":false}]},{"tweetId":"2048711994363044080","sourceUrl":"https://x.com/Gaurav_Cx10/status/2048711994363044080/photo/1","capturedAt":"2026-10-07T16:32:27.674219+00:00","createdAt":"","fullText":"Click to Follow Gaurav_Cx10","author":{"handle":"@Gaurav_Cx10","name":"Gaurav Srivastava (@Gaurav_Cx10)"},"media":[{"type":"photo","url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HG56ZG2aYAAit2S?format=png&name=large"}],"stats":{},"category":"미수집(빈캡처)","quoted":{"tweetId":"","sourceUrl":"","capturedAt":"2026-10-07T16:32:27.674219+00:00","createdAt":"","fullText":"Mark Minervini popularized VCP, probably the most explosive & easiest pattern to spot & understand.\nYet most traders still can't apply it.\nNot because VCP is complicated but because they learn the shape & skip the logic.\nHere's what they miss:\nVCP isn't a chart pattern.\nIt's story of supply being exhausted - one contraction at a time.\nEvery pullback flushes out weak hands. Each wave of selling gets smaller. By the final tight zone - almost all the sellers are gone. What's left is pure demand.\nThat's when you strike.\n\nThe checklist:\n-Prior uptrend ≥30% before the base\n-Stage 2 only - price above the 50 DEMA\n-Relative strength beating the index\n-2-3 contractions - each measurably shallower (eg. T1: 25% → T2: 15% → T3: 5% with tight candles)\n-Volume drying up at every pullback with pocket pivot\n-Entry when T3 tight range breaks\n\nHow I trade it:\nI don't scan for the whole pattern. \nI scan for tight bars first -the coiling. \nThen I look back to see if the full VCP structure is behind it.\nIf yes → mark the pivot → set the alert → wait.\nWhen price breaks the pivot with volume  I execute.\nEntry above pivot. Stop below the T3 low - tightest possible stop & maximum reward.\nSame process. Every setup. No guessing.\nThe pattern works. It has always worked.\nThe only thing that fails is discipline.","author":{"handle":"","name":"인용: (URL 미확인)"},"media":[],"stats":{},"category":""},"replies":[{"tweetId":"2048816030605267141","sourceUrl":"https://x.com/mehraks9/status/2048816030605267141","capturedAt":"2026-10-07T16:32:27.674219+00:00","createdAt":"Apr 28","fullText":"https://youtu.be/XIksouhkwSI?si=o8ETjLnP0y50QOjA…\n\nWatched day before yesterday,  one query! Do you consider Index, Sectors n ....... ? Or \nNear 52 week high only?\n\nThanks Bro....","author":{"handle":"@mehraks9","name":"EquiSwingIN (@mehraks9)"},"media":[],"stats":{},"category":"","isThread":false},{"tweetId":"2048829965890724051","sourceUrl":"https://x.com/Gaurav_Cx10/status/2048829965890724051","capturedAt":"2026-10-07T16:32:27.674219+00:00","createdAt":"Apr 28","fullText":"Index strength is covered through RS\nI am not too strict on sector selection. Sector strength is a bonus not a compulsory one.","author":{"handle":"@Gaurav_Cx10","name":"Gaurav Srivastava (@Gaurav_Cx10)"},"media":[],"stats":{},"category":"","isThread":true}]},{"tweetId":"2049137110192701445","sourceUrl":"https://x.com/Trader_Jesse_/status/2049137110192701445","capturedAt":"2026-10-07T16:33:08.659219+00:00","createdAt":"11:42 PM · Apr 28, 2026","fullText":"한국 시장 스크리너 조건 변경했습니다.\n\n- 가격/거래량/거래대금 하한선 상향\n- ADR% 하향\n- Coiling 된 상태를 찾아내기 위해 이평 조건 변경\n\n6개월 https://kr.tradingview.com/screener/nzf91WHZ/…\n3개월 https://kr.tradingview.com/scr